  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526284",
      "title": "Moving to a Different Folder Structure",
      "lectureOrder": 125,
      "videoOrder": 108,
      "sourceHash": "b68850bedea4fcad15fa208dee2c8e6927defc40aec9daa87f671c4ef386969a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 4.43,
          "en": "Now the style guide is one thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.43,
          "end": 6.13,
          "en": "It helps you write good code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.13,
          "end": 8.62,
          "en": "it helps you name your files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.62,
          "end": 10.52,
          "en": "But there's another aspect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.52,
          "end": 11.71,
          "en": "that you should keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.71,
          "end": 14.14,
          "en": "if you're working on bigger projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.14,
          "end": 18.479,
          "en": "and that is related to how you organize your files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.479,
          "end": 21.01,
          "en": "(indistinct), we have to source folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.01,
          "end": 22.73,
          "en": "and in there we have a components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 22.73,
          "end": 25.36,
          "en": "with all our review components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.36,
          "end": 27.23,
          "en": "This is a typical structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.23,
          "end": 29.29,
          "en": "and there's nothing wrong with it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 29.29,
          "end": 31.95,
          "en": "but in bigger projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.95,
          "end": 34.71,
          "en": "this of course we'll reach certain limits.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.71,
          "end": 38.13,
          "en": "If you have a project with hundreds of components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.13,
          "end": 40.87,
          "en": "having them all in one folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 40.87,
          "end": 42.92,
          "en": "can be very hard to manage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 42.92,
          "end": 45.74,
          "en": "You might have a hard time finding the components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.74,
          "end": 47.34,
          "en": "you are looking for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 47.34,
          "end": 48.18,
          "en": "Therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 48.18,
          "end": 51.13,
          "en": "you might want to consider creating sub folders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 51.13,
          "end": 51.963,
          "en": "For example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 51.963,
          "end": 55.8,
          "en": "we could create a sub folder named base or UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 56.77,
          "end": 60,
          "en": "for all those base components like the card here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 60,
          "end": 62.05,
          "en": "So I'm moving to BaseCard there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.05,
          "end": 63.903,
          "en": "I'm moving the BaseBadge here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 65.35,
          "end": 66.95,
          "en": "Of course, when you do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 66.95,
          "end": 68.66,
          "en": "you want to make sure that you update",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 68.66,
          "end": 70.47,
          "en": "all the imports you're using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 70.47,
          "end": 72.32,
          "en": "So in main.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 72.32,
          "end": 74.773,
          "en": "I'm now importing BaseBadge from components/UI/BaseBadge,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 77.15,
          "end": 80.098,
          "en": "and the same for the BaseCard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 80.098,
          "end": 81.89,
          "en": "Otherwise Vue will not be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 81.89,
          "end": 83.1,
          "en": "to find these things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 83.1,
          "end": 84.633,
          "en": "and your project will break.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 86.24,
          "end": 87.247,
          "en": "Now that's the folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 87.247,
          "end": 89.99,
          "en": "for the general base components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.99,
          "end": 91.97,
          "en": "We could also create a subfolder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 91.97,
          "end": 95.13,
          "en": "inside of the components folder named layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 95.13,
          "end": 98.50999999999999,
          "en": "where replace things like the header or the footer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 98.50999999999999,
          "end": 100.15,
          "en": "if you have one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 100.15,
          "end": 101.12,
          "en": "So therefore of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 101.12,
          "end": 105.27000000000001,
          "en": "make sure you also updates the import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 105.27000000000001,
          "end": 107.363,
          "en": "in app.vue in our case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 108.91,
          "end": 112.46000000000001,
          "en": "And then you might have various other components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 112.46000000000001,
          "end": 115.06,
          "en": "which you might want to organize by feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 115.06,
          "end": 117.39,
          "en": "If you're building an online shop application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 117.39,
          "end": 118.47,
          "en": "for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 118.47,
          "end": 120.66,
          "en": "you could have a subfolder named cart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 120.66,
          "end": 123.85,
          "en": "where you have all the cart related components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 123.85,
          "end": 125.75,
          "en": "You could have a subfolder named checkout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 125.75,
          "end": 128.25,
          "en": "for the checkout related components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 128.25,
          "end": 131.14,
          "en": "one named products for the components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 131.14,
          "end": 135.29,
          "en": "that are dealing with outputting products and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 135.29,
          "end": 138.24,
          "en": "Now here I have various demo components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 138.24,
          "end": 139.43,
          "en": "because this here in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 139.43,
          "end": 141.23,
          "en": "isn't a real app which we're building",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 141.23,
          "end": 143.63,
          "en": "and therefore I will just leave them here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 143.63,
          "end": 145.23,
          "en": "But in the next module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 145.23,
          "end": 146.76,
          "en": "we're going to use everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 146.76,
          "end": 150.45,
          "en": "we learned about components over the last modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 150.45,
          "end": 152.73,
          "en": "and we're going to build a full application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 152.73,
          "end": 153.74,
          "en": "from scratch.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 153.74,
          "end": 157.15,
          "en": "And there you will see a proper folder structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 157.15,
          "end": 159.77,
          "en": "in place to manage all the components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 159.77,
          "end": 162.46,
          "en": "Because there will then have a real application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 162.46,
          "end": 164.6,
          "en": "where this makes more sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 164.6,
          "end": 167.56,
          "en": "For now, just be aware of the fact",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 167.56,
          "end": 170.17000000000002,
          "en": "that you might need to restructure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 170.17000000000002,
          "end": 172.32999999999998,
          "en": "your folders here at some point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 172.32999999999998,
          "end": 174.143,
          "en": "to keep your code manageable.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
